ackground volume that does not translate into a valid temporal chain.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_20982933\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1385, 1186, 639, 1818],\n  \"window\": [61549, 99948],\n  \"confidence\": 0.9,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"1385 emits exactly one event (to hub 639) around t\u224872.5-75k, while 1186's only interaction (1818\u21921186) occurs earlier, around t\u224865-67k, with no further 1186 activity through 99948. Since the target's only possible influence-receiving event precedes the source's only emission, no time-respecting, \u2264600-unit-gap cascade from 1385 to 1186 can exist. The apparent connection is purely a time-ignoring artifact of the very high-degree hub 639 and the multi-in-degree relay 1818.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 38343, "total_output_tokens": 3675, "total_tokens": 42018, "total_latency_ms": 55906, "llm_calls": 7, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}